remain proprietary Google software. No license to Google's APKs is granted
by the integration source license. No Google APK is modified or re-signed.

The fetched Camera base and nine feature splits are pinned to:
its-hecker/infinity_cnb_proprietary_vendor_google_coral
commit d1409c6066f977639a99d276709e3a70e7a9b3c0, camera/prebuilt/
The original release and every APK fingerprint are in provenance/source.json.
The tested archive layout and chunk fingerprints are in provenance/payload.json.
The public certificate is extracted from the original Google-signed APK;
only that package receives a signer mapping when the base has none.

Underlying platform integration: AOSP / LineageOS / Project Infinity X.
This is an independent Floral ROM build integration, not an official Google product.
